title: LZW code spans three sub-blocks
description: 3x1 frame, LZW minimum code size 10, so codes are 11 bits. The
description: codes clear, 0, 1, 2, EOI are split into sub-blocks of 3, 1 and 3
description: bytes. The third code (green) straddles all three sub-blocks.
description: Expect red,green,blue.
